1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
我們把公館汀州路三段，打造成數位孿生場景。
We recreated Section 3 of Tingzhou Road in Gongguan as a digital twin.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
用來產生訓練影像，也能反覆測試自動避閃。
It generates training images and lets us repeat avoidance tests.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,800
像這樣突然切入的車，就可能讓騎士來不及反應。
A sudden cut-in like this may leave a rider too little time to react.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:19,400
如果視線不佳，又有車違停在路中間，風險就更難判斷。
Poor visibility and a car stopped in the lane make the risk harder to judge.

5
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:25,200
所以，我們想開發一套給機車使用的自動避閃系統。
That is why we want to develop an automatic avoidance system for scooters.

6
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:31,000
希望在騎士來不及反應時，協助煞車或避讓，降低碰撞風險。
Our goal is to assist with braking or steering when a rider has too little time to react.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,800
目前，我們已經訓練了第一版視覺模型。
We have already trained our first vision model.

8
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:39,800
畫面上的框，就是模型辨識出的汽車和機車。
These boxes show the cars and motorcycles detected by the model.

9
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:44,600
但光知道有車，還不夠判斷會不會撞上。
Recognizing a vehicle alone does not tell us whether it is in our path.

10
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,400
所以我們加入 Raycast，模擬雷達的距離感測。
We add raycasts to simulate radar-like distance sensing.

11
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:54,200
量出障礙物的距離，並估計它的移動方向。
They measure obstacle distance and estimate its motion.

12
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,500
辨識結果會和射線偵測到的物體配對。
Visual detections are matched to objects detected by the rays.

13
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:03,000
再交給規則控制器，決定煞車或繞開。
A rule-based controller then decides whether to brake or steer around.

14
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,800
這樣做，也能減少不必要的反應。
This can also reduce unnecessary responses.

15
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:09,600
像這台停在路邊的車，其實沒有擋住路徑。
This roadside car is visible, but it is not blocking our path.

16
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:13,600
只看影像框的左邊，卻把它當成威脅而煞車。
The image-box rule on the left treats it as a hazard and brakes.

17
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:18,400
右邊結合 Raycast 確認能通過，就能少一次虛警。
On the right, raycast geometry confirms clearance and avoids this false alarm.

18
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:21,700
再來看剛才的濃霧情境。
Now let us return to the dense-fog scenario.

19
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:27,000
這次測試裡，純視覺沒有及時發出警戒，最後發生碰撞。
In this test, the vision-only warning rule fails to alert in time, and a collision follows.

20
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,800
這時即使視覺沒有可靠的辨識結果，
Even without reliable visual detections,

21
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:38,600
Raycast 仍能提供距離資訊，讓系統避開障礙。
raycasts still provide distance information for avoidance in this simulation.

22
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:42,400
目前，視覺模型還是跑在電腦 GPU 上。
The vision model currently runs on the computer GPU.

23
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:46,400
拿到 UGen300 後，我們會把模型部署到裝置，
With UGen300, we plan to deploy the model on the device,

24
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:50,200
量測延遲、耗電，以及量化後的辨識表現。
and measure latency, power use, and detection quality after quantization.

25
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:55,000
再加入更多道路、光線變化和真實影像，
We will add more roads, lighting conditions, and real camera data,

26
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,000
讓這套系統一步步適應更一般的路況。
and work toward adapting the system to a wider range of road conditions.
